cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "voting-unmixing-ph: spectral unmixing of Philippine senatorial votes"
abstract: >-
  Treats precinct-level Philippine senatorial election returns as mixtures of
  a few voting archetypes and recovers them with hyperspectral unmixing
  (HySime, MVSA or NMF, and SUNSAL), with a static explorer for the results.
type: software
authors:
